&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in GNC, flight dynamics, astrodynamics, aerospace engineering, robotics or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of dynamic systems and vehicle behaviour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing software in C++, Python or similar languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex engineering concepts into practical, testable implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively across disciplinary boundaries with systems, avionics and flight software engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering curiosity combined with technical rigour and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort moving between equations, simulation results, flight data, software and system-level behaviour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
